{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41159666",
      "title": "Revisiting The Concept Of Layouts",
      "lectureOrder": 97,
      "videoOrder": 90,
      "sourceHash": "6b43e24ea3173e233de26241cd90d24dab150615ada59dadc7f5b788fd7d2277",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.18,
          "en": "So let's now start working on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "and let's start making it look better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "and make it more useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "And for that, I actually want to start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "by adding a proper header and navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "and logo to this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "And for that, I'll actually work on that layout.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "Because the idea behind layouts in NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "is that they act as wrappers around pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.74,
          "en": "And you can theoretically also have nested layouts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.74,
          "end": 34.08,
          "en": "where a subset of pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.08,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "could also use another more specialized layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "So you are not limited to this one root layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 42.573,
          "en": "which we have here in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 47.07,
          "en": "It's worth noting, though, that if you had a nested layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.07,
          "end": 50.97,
          "en": "so if we had a layout in this meals folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "then this layout here would indeed only become active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "for those meals-related pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "but it would itself be nested into the root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 64.29,
          "en": "So the root layout will always be active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.29,
          "end": 66.75,
          "en": "And I can quickly show this to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.75,
          "end": 70.28999999999999,
          "en": "by adding a component function to this layout.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.28999999999999,
          "end": 72.3,
          "en": "Because layouts, like pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.3,
          "end": 75.09,
          "en": "are, in the end, React components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.09,
          "end": 77.73,
          "en": "And I'll name this meals layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.73,
          "end": 81.123,
          "en": "And then here, I'll return, let's say, a fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 84.45,
          "en": "Where I'll simply at a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.45,
          "end": 86.07300000000001,
          "en": "which says Meals layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "And which below that paragraph should then output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 92.52000000000001,
          "en": "the actual page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.52000000000001,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "And for that, those layout components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 98.43299999999999,
          "en": "can use the special children prop that exists in React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now, you learn that every component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "can accept and use this prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 107.85,
          "en": "and that normally the content that's made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.85,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "through that prop here will be the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "wrapped by those component tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 116.46000000000001,
          "en": "So if I were using MealsLayout like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 119.82,
          "en": "then this content here between those tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.82,
          "end": 123.543,
          "en": "is what would be made available through that children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.95,
          "end": 127.98,
          "en": "However, in case of layouts and pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.98,
          "end": 131.34,
          "en": "we aren't rendering those components ourselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.34,
          "end": 134.25,
          "en": "We're not using them in JSX code ourselves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.25,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "instead, NextJS is using them for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 141.36,
          "en": "But NextJS will essentially wrap that layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.36,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "around all pages or nested layouts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "that are covered by this layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 149.01,
          "en": "And therefore, children will give you access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.01,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "to any nested layouts or pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 154.82999999999998,
          "en": "And hence, we can output the page content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.82999999999998,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "with children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "And that's also what happens in that root layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 163.05,
          "en": "which, as mentioned, will still be active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.05,
          "end": 164.793,
          "en": "even if you have a nested layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.72,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "Now, this root layout also accepts this children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "and uses it to output the wrapped content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "which, again, are pages or other layouts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 179.223,
          "en": "nested layouts like this meals layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "That's how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 184.14,
          "en": "And with that nested layout added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.14,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "you'll see that on the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 188.28,
          "en": "we don't see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.28,
          "end": 190.98,
          "en": "We don't see that text meals layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.98,
          "end": 193.98,
          "en": "anywhere on the screen on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.98,
          "end": 197.97,
          "en": "But if I go to a meals page, we see it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 201.06,
          "en": "And yet the root layout is still active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.06,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "as you can, for example, tell by this SVG,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 207.723,
          "en": "this brownish SVG, which is still visible here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.04,
          "end": 210.84,
          "en": "So that's how layouts work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.84,
          "end": 213.87,
          "en": "But here, we actually don't need that nested layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 215.253,
          "en": "hence I'll delete it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.17000000000002,
          "end": 219.9,
          "en": "But we will now work on the root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.9,
          "end": 224.88,
          "en": "to add some header that's visible on all pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.88,
          "end": 228.573,
          "en": "some header that allows us to navigate between those pages.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
